OL,3,ANoughties garage track named TikTok's
OL,4,AUK song of the summer
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish singer Kyla's Do You Mind has
OL,7,Fbeen named as TikTok's song of the
OL,8,Fsummer in the UK after the noughties
OL,9,Fgarage track experienced a resurgence
OL,10,Fon the app.
OL,12,FThe song gained popularity when it was
OL,13,Ffirst released in 2008, but it became
OL,14,Fknown worldwide in 2016 when Canadian
OL,15,Frapper Drake sampled it on his
OL,16,Fchart-topping single One Dance.
OL,18,FIt has now found a new audience by
OL,19,Ftrending on TikTok, generating more
OL,20,Fthan 500 million views from about
OL,21,F650,000 videos posted in the UK over
OL,22,Fthe summer, according to the platform.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
